# Test Bench - generic single-monitor setup
# Link as ~/.config/sway/config.d/outputs.conf on machines/testbench.
# The i3-9100F has no iGPU; outputs are provided by the installed NVIDIA card.

# Keep this intentionally minimal until the actual connector name and monitor
# layout are recorded from `swaymsg -t get_outputs` on the bench.
output * scale 1

# No workspace-to-output assignments yet: a nonexistent connector name would be
# misleading on a machine whose GPU may be swapped during bench work.
